## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ZugzugLevelerCharDB

# One TOC for both games, as RXPGuides.toc does: a file tagged
# [AllowLoadGameType camelot] loads only on Forever, [AllowLoadGameType mists]
# only on Mists of Pandaria Classic. The routes, talents, professions plan and
# danger list are Forever's; Mists gets its own quest data and quest log mode.

